00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:25.432
ELECTION.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:27.534
&gt;&gt; BILL NELSON IS CLEARLY A SORE

00:00:27.535 --> 00:00:27.834
LOSER.

00:00:27.835 --> 00:00:28.535
HE CAN'T STAND THE FACT THAT

00:00:28.536 --> 00:00:29.736
HE'S NOT GOING TO BE ELECTED FOR

00:00:29.737 --> 00:00:31.238
