00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:33.740
ELECTION.

00:00:33.741 --> 00:00:34.808
THAT'S WHAT HE'S DONE.

00:00:34.809 --> 00:00:37.310
HIS LAWYER SAID I'M HERE TO WIN

00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:37.744
THE ELECTION.

