NOT HERE TO GET A FREE AND FAIR

00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:40.981
ELECTION, MAKE SURE VOTES ARE

00:00:40.982 --> 00:00:41.314
COUNTED.

00:00:41.315 --> 00:00:43.150
NO, HE WANTS TO WIN.

00:00:43.151 --> 00:00:44.051
THAT'S HIS ONLY PURPOSE.

00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:48.221
WE STILL DON'T UNDERSTAND HOW

00:00:48.222 --> 00:00:53.160
THEY WENT IN THESE COUNTIES.

00:00:53.161 --> 00:00:56.063
THEY CAME UP WITH 93,000 VOTES

00:00:56.064 --> 00:00:56.630
AFTER ELECTION NIGHT.

00:00:56.631 --> 00:00:57.664
WE DON'T KNOW HOW THEY CAME UP

00:00:57.665 --> 00:00:58.565
WITH IT.

00:00:58.566 --> 00:00:59.232
WE ARE TRYING TO FIGURE WHAT

00:00:59.233 --> 00:01:01.268
HAPPENED.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.804
I HAVE ASKED THE LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:01:03.805 --> 00:01:05.172
