&gt;&gt; Dana: NELSON IS CALLING ON

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:14.014
SCOTT TO RECUSE HIMSELF IN THE

00:01:14.015 --> 00:01:19.586
RECOUNT PROCESS.

00:01:19.587 --> 00:01:20.987
&gt;&gt; RICK SCOTT ISN'T INTERESTED

00:01:20.988 --> 00:01:22.989
